#ROOM
Vnum     200
Name     &COrbital Transfer Shuttle &w:: &zDen Haag Arrivals~
Sector   city~
Flags    nomob indoors~
Desc     Crash-rated seats line both sides of a narrow transfer-shuttle aisle.
Overhead handrails and recessed lockers secure baggage during orbital hops.
Sealed viewports frame docking lights and traffic around the terminal.
Aft pressure doors connect the cabin with the active docking collar.
Status panels above the hatch track berth and approach information.
~
#ENDROOM
#ROOM
Vnum     201
Name     &CInterstellar Arrival Berth &w:: &zDen Haag Arrivals~
Sector   city~
